  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alternative and innovative funding - ToT and cohort-based support related to OCIF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to contribute to closing the funding gap for young impact entrepreneurs. The in-depth learning programme will take one cohort of OCIF entrepreneurs through a learning journey to discover the full spectrum of alternative funding, and choosing the right funding route for their business. Simultaneously, as the programme will be provided as a Training of Trainers format, it will enhance the capacity of the OCIF Fund managers, by engaging them in the content and the process of unlocking alternative and innovative funding, better equipping them to identify and mobilize the right type of funding for the future (OCIF) entrepreneurs they will support.</narrative>
  </description>
